## Interface: 16001, 16002
## Title: Follow Line
## Notes: Puts your party or raid in a follow line: one player orders the line, everyone else gets a Follow button (or key) for the player ahead of them, and the window shows who is on the line and who dropped off.
## Version: 1.0.0
## SavedVariables: FollowLineDB
